## SQ-FFB-02 | sponge cake: one baking recipe, nothing else makes it, no can takes it
@group A
@commands recipe probe (RecipeManager dump or `/zq`) for every recipe with output `oceanic_delight:sponge_cake`
@pass exactly one: a `creativeengineering:baking` recipe (`creativedelight:baking/sponge_cake`) with pie crust, `minecraft:sponge`, `minecraft:prismarine_shard`, 2 sweeteners, pie tin as tool; no crafting, Cooking Pot or can recipe outputs it; no can takes it
@fails `baking.js` lines 152-155 (`F._sweep`, `R.ceBaking`)
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest makes oceanic_delight:sponge_cake
> cdevtest rdetail sponge_cake
> cdevtest uses oceanic_delight:sponge_cake
waitlog verb=uses item=oceanic_delight:sponge_cake alone= 30
expect verb=makes item=oceanic_delight:sponge_cake n=1$
expect id=creativedelight:baking/sponge_cake result=oceanic_delight:sponge_cake\*
expect verb=rdetail id=creativedelight:baking/sponge_cake serializer=creativeengineering:baking
reject verb=uses id=\S*canned
reject (Unknown (item|block|entity)|Unknown or incomplete command|Incorrect argument for command|\[(zsb|zlbs)\] (error|unknown)|verb=\S+ .*done=0)
look the rdetail line: pie crust, minecraft:sponge, minecraft:prismarine_shard, 2 sweeteners, pie tin (tool)

