## SQ-CF-02 | Spice of Life world config from defaultconfigs: movement speed attribute (A, new level)
@group A (new level)
@commands copy `configs_edited/server_config/solapplepie-server.toml` into `OUT/srv/defaultconfigs/` before the first boot; boot; `grep -oE "generic\.(movement_)?speed,[0-9.]+" OUT/srv/world/serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml`; `grep -nE "minFoodsToActivate\|resetOnDeath\|queueSize" OUT/srv/world/serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml`; `grep -niE "solapplepie" logs/latest.log \| grep -iE "warn\|error" \| head`
@pass world copy has `generic.movement_speed,0.01` and no `generic.speed,2`; 10 / true / 256; no attribute warning (only the 4 known `largemeals` complexity warnings)
@fails defaultconfigs not copied (scratch setup or `build_deploy.py`); attribute name
@from batches/r1103/sB_2.qb
bootexpect Done \(
shell L=$(grep -m1 '^level-name=' server.properties | cut -d= -f2); f="$L/serverconfig/solapplepie-server.toml"; ls -l defaultconfigs/solapplepie-server.toml "$f"; grep -oE "generic\.(movement_)?speed,[0-9.]+" "$f"; grep -nE "minFoodsToActivate|resetOnDeath|queueSize" "$f"; grep -niE "solapplepie" logs/latest.log | grep -iE "warn|error" | head; grep -q "generic.movement_speed,0.01" "$f" && ! grep -q "generic.speed,2" "$f"
bootreject (?i)solapplepie.*(attribute|unknown).*(warn|error|invalid)
# areas for the whole batch; 30 s before any block tick
> gamerule doMobSpawning false
> gamerule doDaylightCycle false
> time set noon
> weather clear 100000
> forceload add -8 -8 170 16
> forceload add 296 16 364 40
> forceload add 96 496 212 512
sleep 30
