## SQ-FO-16 | chicken, duck and goose eggs fry; parrot, turtle and reptile eggs do not
@group A
@commands `cdevtest tag item creativedelight:eggs/fryable`; `cdevtest tag item rusticdelight:raw_cooked_eggs`; rdetail `fried_egg_from_eggs` and `fried_eggs_from_cooking_oil`
@pass fryable holds exactly `minecraft:egg`, `untitledduckmod:duck_egg`, `untitledduckmod:goose_egg`; raw_cooked_eggs holds those three and the `#forge:cooked_eggs` members, no turtle, parrot, crocodile, terrapin or emu egg; smoker and campfire fried egg recipes take `#creativedelight:eggs/fryable`; the oil batch takes the tag three times; Fried Turtle Egg still cooks from the turtle egg
@fails `i.t_eggs_fryable` missing (Common jar older than G2a's dict edit: recipes on `minecraft:egg`); `wipeTag` left the upstream `#forge:eggs` reference
> cdevtest tag item creativedelight:eggs/fryable
> cdevtest tag item rusticdelight:raw_cooked_eggs
> cdevtest rdetail fried_egg_from_eggs
> cdevtest rdetail fried_eggs_from_cooking_oil
